        <body>
            <div xml:id="d438">

                <pb facs="0672" n="660" sameAs="frus:frus1945v06/pg660"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">SWNCC 21 Series</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the State-War-Navy Coordinating
                        Committee</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-08-14">14 August,
                        1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum for the Secretary, Joint Chiefs of
                        Staff</hi>:</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Subject: Instruments for the surrender of Japan.</p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>Reference is made to your memorandum on the above subject dated 14 August
                        1945. (SM–2866)</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>The Army member of the SWNCC proposes to amend the General Order attached
                        thereto, as proposed by the Joint Chiefs of Staff, by inserting the
                        following sentence after paragraph 1 <hi rendition="#italic">e</hi>.: <quote
                            rend="blockquote">
                            <p>“The above indicated commanders are the only representatives of the
                                Allied Powers empowered to accept surrender, and all surrenders of
                                Japanese Forces shall be made only to them or to their designated
                                representatives.[”]</p>
                        </quote>
                    </item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>It is requested that this matter be brought to the attention of the Joint
                        Chiefs of Staff as a matter of urgency and that their comments, when
                        obtained, be forwarded to the State-War-Navy Coordinating Committee.</item>
                </list>
                <closer>For the State-War-Navy Coordinating Committee: <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvin</hi> F. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Richardson</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary, SWNCC</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
